data devboot_fleet_proof_capture_note: String = "Observation capture lands before rerun (operator sequencing 2026-08-10). capture_fleet_proof_harvest_bundle reads observation files from devboot_fleet_proof_observation_sites (target/devboot-fleet-proof-observations/ after fleet-modeled-proof.sh). The 2026-08-09 operator-verified run is preserved as fixture files for witnesses only; its modeled-serve.log predates compile_count= in SERVED prose, so harvest refuses producer_compile_count until a post-seam capture rerun writes a fresh log."
